
Every class that inherits from `ExceptionManager` automatically gains:
- `handle_exception()` — generic exception handler with full traceback
- `clientExceptionHandler()` — Binance `ClientError`-specific handler
- All Discord webhook send methods from `DiscordManager`

`BinanceAutomation` composes (not inherits) `SignalAnalyzer`, `OrderManager`, `TradeChecker`, and `Croner`.

